### Terraform ###
# Provider plugin cache — hundreds of MB, machine-specific, recreated by `terraform init`
.terraform/

# Local state file — contains secrets in plaintext, must never be committed
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Crash logs, if Terraform ever crashes mid-apply
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Environment-specific variable files. These may contain real values
# (including the postgres password). Commit `terraform.tfvars.example`
# instead — the shape without the values, same pattern as `.env.example`.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# CLI configuration and plan files — local artefacts
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
*.tfplan